{"script":"s_3_7_4_n","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]已经拿到对付魔爪蛇的装备了吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]嗯？你们手头上并没有那种装备呢，是不是忘记了？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"","text":"[show]（现在还没有东西可以交付呢，赶快打造一件即抛型蛇鳞刺盾吧。）[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"将 1 个即抛型蛇鳞刺盾交给大市集的文员拉比尔【c3_area3_1】。"}